### Register
POST http://127.0.0.1:8089/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"uc01-demo","password":"secret123","nickname":"UC01 Demo","phone":"13800138000","email":"uc01-demo@example.com"}

### Login
POST http://127.0.0.1:8089/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"uc01-demo","password":"secret123"}

### Admin list; replace token
GET http://127.0.0.1:8089/api/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer <jwt>
